# A3 + ALWAYS-SHOW (2026-07-11): an UNREACHABLE server during the pre-launch save check
# (engine exit 3) logs the honest action=card-offline — never "no server saves" — and the
# card STILL shows: it is honest offline (local saves/states + "unreachable"), so the user
# always gets the menu even when the gate failed. The 2026-07-02 Smart Pro field session:
# tailscaled never came up, --list-saves printed nothing with rc=0, and the pak showed
# "No server saves for ✓ Pokemon Emerald" while both revisions sat on the server.
desc fetch hook: list-saves unreachable (rc=3) -> honest card-offline log + card still shows
invoke prehook
config paired
romarg Roms/Game Boy Advance (GBA)/✓ Zelda.gba
sdfile+ Roms/Game Boy Advance (GBA)/✓ Zelda.gba
engine 3|
wizard 0|LAUNCHCARD mode=summoned shown=1 action=play evicted=0
expect_exit 0
expect_trace ENGINE --list-saves
expect_trace_absent LIST[
expect_trace WIZARD --launch-card --summoned
expect_trace_absent ENGINE --restore-save
expect_log newest=none action=card-offline
